"sare berean dagoela."

#: modules/gui/qt/util/renderer_manager.cpp:889
msgid ""
"Windows Firewall doesn't let %1 connect to this computer to read the video."
msgstr ""
"Windows suebakiak ez dio %1 gailuari uzten ordenagailu honetara konektatzen "
"bideoa irakurtzeko."

